Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing That
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,surely someday we just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver. With our\Ndreaming hand, let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your\Nhands up Sing about what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:01:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you are dreaming Always\Nstand up Raise up the flag
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That you believe in. Gotta\Nkeep up. We'll get past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone that's in our way,\Nlet's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up Keep your head up way up\Nhigh Always step up If waves are rough,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,jump to the sky Never give up Our wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,they will come together And\Nlead us on for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the\Nwaves Towards another
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,shore day by day There are many meetings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,many goodbyes Underneath the flag we fly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within. I'll keep\Nit in my heart forever. And never take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,lightly But I won't surrender This freedom\NI will keep in mind I'll keep holding on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,never stop it Now everybody\Nlift your hands up Sing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,about what you are dreaming\NAlways stand up Raise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Up the flag that you believe\Nin. Gotta keep up. We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,get past everyone that's\Nin our way Let's head on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,never stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up. Keep your head up, way up\Nhigh. Always step up. If brains are up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,jump to the sky Never give up Our wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,they will come together And\Nlead us on for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.92,0:02:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A member of the Seven\NWarlords Trafalgar Law
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A powerful rookie who's butted heads with\Nthe world government countless times,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,His Gourmet, the demon child,\NNico Robin, is with him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The others appear to be Smoker\Nand Tashigi from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:03:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, how did Caesar\Nget his hands on so many big shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.66,0:03:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where they ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, huh? Little punk, finally got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Off his ass, fancy that. I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't end well and I prefer more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,hands-on approach
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to violence huh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Same I wonder what Straw Hat is\Ndoing with a warlord though probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar's idea and here\NI thought he'd lost his
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,spine when he sold out to\Nthe government that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up to something big. Mark my\Nwords, and Straw Hats are in on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't do us any good worrying about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on our team fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't pick a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we just got here man\Nyou don't have to look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so freaked out already\Nwhat the hell is this do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you have a death wish nobody smashes up my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,hideout and gets away with\Nit we tried to stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,please don't be angry\Ni was just making sure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't have any\Nsnipers waiting to pick me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,off when your enemy\Ninvites you to his base you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta take proper\Nprecautions know what i mean
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratchman is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have invited\Nhim in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll be worth the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, screw this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill both of you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You do want me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.92,0:04:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can get with this, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hear us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone calm down and shut the hell up.\NWe didn't call you here to pick a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to form an alliance\Nwith both of your crews.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try this again, like\Ncivilized men, this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a comeback huh\Nyeah somebody's got to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,clean this mess up we've\Nwasted enough time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a couple of ideas,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but if anyone here can burn\Nthings, that might speed this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky can make fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Laser beams, too. Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have thought of that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you melt our chains off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need both hands to\Nshoot my radical beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one thing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight from my butt. Coo-da-boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, can you set fire to\Nthat Navy ship down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask, and I deliver, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit back and watch me work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that? Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that\Npacifista-looking dance up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing a temper tantrum\Nfrom inside his cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Absurd but take heart,\Nmy dear mechanical man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're dead, I'll\Nput your body to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,in my lab I can't see the\Ncage hope they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain don't die don't\Nlet the smoke get you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,smoky yeah I think the\Nsmoke guy's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now Trafalgar you didn't\Nthink this one through too well did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who burned the ship. Only
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,cuz you asked me to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that Caesar's Video
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,transponder snails can't\Nsee us we'll have a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Minute before he figures\Nout what's going on, you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,better get this plan moving quick though I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,don't get it how'd you\NGet those chains off their
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,sea prism stone right\Nno mine were ordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,chains though no one\Nknew That nothing here my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,power can't take care\Nof think for a second
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been on the island\Nfor months now. I was
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,prepared for something\Nlike this to happen as
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,soon as I noticed the\Nsea prism chains Around
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the lab I started\Nreplacing them with normal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,chains I could easily\Nswitch out with my Power
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,obviously I couldn't trust\NCaesar so this is no surprise
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,still
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,in a cage you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free, I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some other\Ndistinguished guests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You've learned a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both at my mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting our time,\Ndammit You want to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it already
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your marine stop screaming\Nlike a school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get the chains off, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here and\NI'll do anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A marine would rather die than\Nbeg a pirate for their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have other things to\Nworry about and other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get killed over our stupid pride,\Nthen all of our men are as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Vice Admiral will...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:09:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll continue to cover\Nup what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I have no obligation to\Nspare your life, White Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if you make it out of\Nhere and ruin Vergo's reputation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then that suits my ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to forget all you\Nheard about me and Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a petty request.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You give me that, and\NI give you your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what's going on down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! No more waiting.\NI'm gonna go sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot doesn't even know the plan. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have kept him chained up then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to get inside here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, do you need my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'd really rather\Ngo check up on the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over feverishly up out of my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It draws closer still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, it seems the dragon is much\Nmore adept in running than we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta catch up so\Nwe can fly out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit longer, Samji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami isn't built for this kind of abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Her lungs can't take anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, my chest is\Nreally starting to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's that easy, you should\Nhave done it in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm coming down with\Nsomething just looking at that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there a little longer, Brownie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're injured, so thank\Nyou for carrying us like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are bite-sized compared to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.56,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I gotta get back\Nand rescue my men either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta help those kids, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we can make it there\Nbefore they eat that candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not the only ones\Nrunning from the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The shutter's opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how the hell they got the\Nthing open, but this is a big emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did some moron in here\Ntouch the lever?! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Those G5 guys are pouring in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that's Vice Admiral Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warlord Trafalgar Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And the famous pirate Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the Master had them locked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our men are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if we can get my heart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm working with pirates. How shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that in front of the poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.14,0:13:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so close! Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all about to die out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead after all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And we tried so hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, I seem to be giving\Nup the ghost already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have company soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, get him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can cut through iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Most certainly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep up the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to dash my\Nfriends out on that wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there's a giant hole in the shotter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, I'm here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's time to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.96,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we made it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means the gas can come in, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you idiots thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die with you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's plug up that hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to be quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Doomsday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not an inch of the\Nisland remains habitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The gas is still as thick\Nas pea soup out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One foot out the door would undoubtedly\Nmean a swift and painful death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how does it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Leak and ravage like\Nsomething from a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly terrifying. You're terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.48,0:15:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing about this is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We were safe here till you\Ncame barging through the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't even help us plug up the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have pissed us\Noff one too many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Play nice, Straw Hats, or\Nwe'll blow your heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like we can go back outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No running now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing we don't need to run then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we should have seen this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute they think they're threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They said my name. They've heard of me.\NHey, things are heating up down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen you two will not\Ninterfere with me or
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and his crew\Nunderstood all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, do your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch us back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't listen to her! We're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The dream is over now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I wearing a different coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you take off my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain. Explore. Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.01,0:17:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My body hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And from a whole lot more than one punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he beat Nami pretty\Nbadly, actually. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad he hurt my body and not hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are a prince among men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, everybody, shut\Nup and listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you may have noticed, the whole\Nisland is filled with poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a passage that's\Ncompletely enclosed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a tall door marked R-66.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the entrance to the\Npassage that leads to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not massacre everybody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You have two hours to find your way out,\Nand if not, I can't guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something gonna happen to the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Depends on how things turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For right now, I have\Nto do what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.80,0:18:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,G-5!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There are prisoners here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Young children who were\Nkidnapped two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mission is to retrieve them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then find the door that's labeled R-66.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If what law told us was true,\Nthat passage leads to a harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal a ship and we'll\Nkiss Punk Hazard goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The children, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and look for those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When we find them, we need to get them\Nto building R, door R66. I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go alone. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much longer, Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save you, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see to it for you. Thanks. Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get ready, Caesar,\Nbecause I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I won't pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll kick your\Nass, then I'll kidnap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tshiki, until I get back I'm leaving\Nyou in charge of the men, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But where are you going, Smoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There go, that's who you're after, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him get away
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The law won't see that traitor punished\Nthe way he deserves to be You know that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to handle it myself.\NNobody screws around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,with my navy wait at\Nleast take me with you sir
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i can help you know how strong Brook is if
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,something were to happen\Nto you then our men
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,would need someone to look after them go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:20:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,toshiki help those fools\Nescape the children too
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,good luck vice admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is it true Luffy\Nreally got beaten by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,maniac caesar it's true\Nand there was even a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,little bit of suffocation\Nthrown into the mix
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,for good measure manipulates\Ngas and that makes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,him one dangerous bastard\Nhe sucks the oxygen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,right out of the air we\Nlet the yetis get the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop on us now. This crap\Ntoo that is so pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we gave up two years
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,was it all for nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,well try looking at it this way we're all\Nstill alive aren't we maybe not for long
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,if we keep letting ourselves get\Ncaught off guard we're gonna get killed
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Steaks are high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.62,0:21:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A kick in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't happen again, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him down before he\Ncan do anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take anything seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
